        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085510/extras/99481ee0a22042b5c59fa287973206bc.webp?t=1788031114\" width=617 height=63 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">---------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Hello, I'm Dylan, a solo indie developer from Australia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">I was inspired to create this game by my love for classic platformers, especially games like <i>Crash Bandicoot</i>. I wanted to capture that same sense of fun, adventure, and nostalgic platforming while putting my own spin on the genre.<br><br>Thanks for supporting a Solo Dev.<br>---------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085510/extras/24fccaccbb4988e2beb0ed00a3308086.webp?t=1788031114\" width=617 height=63 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Ahoy, matey!</strong> <br>Join the famously unlucky <strong>Captain Sharkbait</strong> known far and wide for his name... and his <strong>two peg legs!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">One lazy afternoon, while snoozing aboard his &quot;ship&quot; &amp; dreaming of gold and treasure. He’s startled awake by a gentle knocking against the hull. Peering over the side, he spots a message in a bottle bobbing in the waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Could it be...? <strong>Treasure!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Come along with <strong>Captain Sharkbait</strong> for <strong>15 unique levels</strong>.<br>Will <strong>Captain Sharkbait’s</strong> luck finally turn around ?<br><br>---------------------------------------------------------------------<br><br><strong>LEVELS:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Volcanic Vault   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Lava Dash      </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Dead Canary - Gold Mine </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Dead Canary - Cursed Rail</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Kraken’s Dock </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Teocuitatlan - &quot;Place of Divine Gold&quot;  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Blackbeard’s - Molten Fortress</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The Lighthouse - Of Lost Souls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The Last Light</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Area 51 - Restricted Access</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> Escape - Area 51</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">TrenchWyrm - Swallowed Whole</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The Steel Whale - Escape The TrenchWyrm</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">End of the Line - Pull The Brakes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Ghost Town Gold - She’s Set to Blow</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085510/extras/86285bbcea3d3b2d200092937adc096b.webp?t=1788031114\" width=617 height=63 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">---------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>- Smash Every Barrel / Collect every coin.</strong> <br> ( Each level will have a certain amount of barrels or coins to collect )<br><br><strong>- Time Trail</strong><br> ( Race against the clock to complete the time trials, you’ll have to be quick!)<br><br><strong>- Complete every level</strong><br>( Each level completed unlocks a medal ) <br>( Activating unlock all levels cheat will not activate the medal until level is complete )</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085510/extras/ea23884149c9b7c7065b49ea3b18d9e3.webp?t=1788031114\" width=617 height=63 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">---------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>- Big Head Mode</strong><br> ( Turn your characters head 3 times the size )     <br>   <br><strong>- Plunger Sword </strong>  <br>( Has anyone seen my sword ? )   <br>   <br><strong>- Jump Farts </strong>  <br>( Too many beans.... )    <br>   <br><strong>- +5 Lives </strong>  <br>( Some levels can be difficult.... for some )   <br>   <br><strong>- Unlock All levels </strong>  <br>( Stuck ? or just want to explore... unlock all levels )   <br>      <br>      <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085510/extras/e7c5dd61fa5a1cff550bc64350738dec.webp?t=1788031114\" width=617 height=63 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> ---------------------------------------------------------------------<br><strong>This game is playable with:</strong> <br><strong>Keyboard and Mouse -</strong> ( Remappable keys )  <br><strong>Xbox style Gamepad -</strong> ( Non Remappable )</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085510/extras/6cbc15d8e93157e9bc1d00b7af6d17a0.avif?t=1788031114\" width=322 height=276 /></span></p>",
